h, anchor) for a local link target; path empty means same file.\\\\\"\\\\\"\\\\\"\", \"old_string\": \"\\\\\"\\\\\"\\\\\"Return (path, anchor) for a local link target, or None if not local.\\\\\"\\\\\"\\\\\"\"}: 407 bytes, sha256 3283afeb8f0ba5b1b45fc5d3780b60df445f0fd7fbc9744668d0b386c284529e, saved at ~/diet-inference-runs/levers-a/run1/files/3283afeb8f0ba5b1b45fc5d3780b60df445f0fd7fbc9744668d0b386c284529e\n- turn 2: edit args={\"file_path\": \"linkcheck.py\", \"new_string\": \"\\\\\"\\\\\"\\\\\"Return (path, anchor) for a local link target, or None if not local.\\\\n\\\\nAn empty path means the anchor points at the same file.\\\\n\\\\\"\\\\\"\\\\\"\", \"old_string\": \"\\\\\"\\\\\"\\\\\"Return (path, anchor) for a local link target; path empty means same file.\\\\\"\\\\\"\\\\\"\"}: 459 bytes, sha256 53466b38b4a89fb51349870872f10aad81fcfbbdd5fb3f6e298513af920f382f, saved at ~/diet-inference-runs/levers-a/run1/files/53466b38b4a89fb51349870872f10aad81fcfbbdd5fb3f6e298513af920f382f\n- turn 2: edit args={\"file_path\": \"linkcheck.py\", \"new_string\": \"\\\\\"\\\\\"\\\\\"Return (path, anchor) for a local link target, or None if not local (empty path = same file).\\\\\"\\\\\"\\\\\"\", \"old_string\": \"\\\\\"\\\\\"\\\\\"Return (path, anchor) for a local link target, or None if not local.\\\\n\\\\nAn empty path means the anchor points at the same file.\\\\n\\\\\"\\\\\"\\\\\"\"}: 426 bytes, sha256 089d8575c4445ce0232f96df80318a134aa83224436bc32378071316f7ce97c1, saved at ~/diet-inference-runs/levers-a/run1/files/089d8575c4445ce0232f96df80318a134aa83224436bc32378071316f7ce97c1\n- turn 2: bash args={\"command\": \"python3 linkcheck.py docs; echo \\\\\"exit: $?\\\\\"\"}: 54 bytes, sha256 3a9cb466ab8c0e0f8b58f394adcdef4a2277bf2a5b69056aa101d96e50513c5f, saved at ~/diet-inference-runs/levers-a/run1/files/3a9cb466ab8c0e0f8b58f394adcdef4a2277bf2a5b69056aa101d96e50513c5f\n- turn 2: bash args={\"command\": \"mkdir -p .slug && printf '# A\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n# A\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n## Hello, World!\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n[ok1](#a) [ok2](#a-1) [ok3](#hello-world) [bad](#a-2)\\\\\\\\n' > .slug/t.md && python3 linkcheck.py .slug; echo \\\\\"exit: $?\\\\\"; rm -rf .slug\"}: 27 bytes, sha256 ef632f9c3fa40e41023ac9b699935383ccc4349e9835dc7d556cf2034fe0623e, saved at ~/diet-inference-runs/levers-a/run1/files/ef632f9c3fa40e41023ac9b699935383ccc4349e9835dc7d556cf2034fe0623e\n- turn 2: bash args={\"command\": \"mkdir -p .ok && printf '# Top\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n[self](#top) [ext](https://example.com) [mail](mailto:a@b.c)\\\\\\\\n' > .ok/t.md && python3 linkcheck.py .ok; echo \\\\\"exit: $?\\\\\"; rm -rf .ok\"}: 8 bytes, sha256 ca7d38f3b12b1ae7d21fbdcdf92336576bcc3dcba7eb824d7a18cf990947dacf, saved at ~/diet-inference-runs/levers-a/run1/files/ca7d38f3b12b1ae7d21fbdcdf92336576bcc3dcba7eb824d7a18cf990947dacf\n- turn 3: bash args={\"command\": \"seq 1 6000\"}: 28893 bytes, sha256 3d2fde2943fc7a53ac1df5e2aee11acf55f0b126e410057ce039aa962c22c7c8, saved at ~/diet-inference-runs/levers-a/run1/files/3d2fde2943fc7a53ac1df5e2aee11acf55f0b126e410057ce039aa962c22c7c8\n- turn 3: bash args={\"command\": \"wc -l ~/diet-inference-runs/levers-a/run1/files/3d2fde2943fc7a53ac1df5e2aee11acf55f0b126e410057ce039aa962c22c7c8 && head -n 1 ~/diet-inference-runs/levers-a/run1/files/3d2fde2943fc7a53ac1df5e2aee11acf55f0b126e410057ce039aa962c22c7c8 && tail -n 1 ~/diet-inference-runs/levers-a/run1/files/3d2fde2943fc7a53ac1df5e2aee11acf55f0b126e410057ce039aa962c22c7c8\"}: 134 bytes, sha256 29324208380122886e3a100f6ad5387a11a64b4ec570662c7be1564749dd3942, saved at ~/diet-inference-runs/levers-a/run1/files/29324208380122886e3a100f6ad5387a11a64b4ec570662c7be1564749dd3942\n","placement":"message","prefix_hash_after":"28cc089088343c95146637ae552db3742274484e3828b2236b5293d49224bc23","prefix_hash_before":"92bee35ba73f51f11ac7121a02f09a69f6c2afa3fb5bd5f4e9ceebe02c5d4c79","reason":"budget","render":"# regime\narm: levers-a\nsubstrate: accel24-tabbyapi-exl3-qwen38-27b-3p00\ndogma_version: 0\nphase: -\nframe_version: placeholder\n\n# working set\ninterview-t2-0\tdecision: Add `#anchor` validation to `linkcheck.py` for local links — GitHub-st…\ninterview-t2-1\tplan: No open work; optional follow-ups only if asked — verify `[x](b.md#b \"B\")` title-with-anchor handling and decide whether headings inside fenced code blocks should be ignored.\ninterview-t2-2\tsupersede: NONE\\n\\n-- checked against AGENTS.md\n1 older entries shortened\n","render_budget_tokens":120,"render_over_budget":"tier","render_reduced":1,"render_tokens":131,"seq":2804,"t":267029,"tail_tokens":2000,"tool_outputs":"reference","warm":{"cache_n":2560,"draft_n":7,"draft_n_accepted":0,"predicted_ms":40.0,"predicted_n":1,"prompt_ms":5560.0,"prompt_n":6741}}
